---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Spares & Replacements" description="Replacement detectors, compatible components and spares for radiation instruments installed at nuclear plants, research centres and industry.">
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Spares &amp; replacements</h1>
      <p class="lead">Instruments at nuclear stations and laboratories often stay in service for decades. We help keep them running by sourcing exact replacements or proven compatible equivalents.</p>
      <div class="grid" style="margin-top:28px">
        <div class="card"><h3>Replacement detectors</h3><p>GM tubes, proportional counters and neutron detectors matched to your existing monitors.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Compatible components</h3><p>Equivalent parts where the original is discontinued, with datasheet comparison.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Consumables</h3><p>Air sampler filters, filter holders, batteries, cables and probes.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Check sources &amp; calibration items</h3><p>Accessories to verify instrument response in the field.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>How to send a spares enquiry</h2>
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li>Make and model of the instrument (or a photo of its label)</li>
        <li>Part number or detector type, if known</li>
        <li>Quantity and site / end user</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/contact/?type=spares">Send spares enquiry</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
